0..75 Comment "// What a dependent arrow whose codomain names its binder refuses: it is no"
76..145 Comment "// plain arrow. A family that reads to a type over its argument stays"
146..223 Comment "// a dependent codomain once it is read, so a function over it does not stand"
224..256 Comment "// at the arrow to any one type."
